  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每二十年坠落塔顶的Aestheta之星会实现一个愿望，月面居民因此举办决定登塔资格的跨时空战士大赛。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Every 20 years a celestial body known as the Star of Aestheta falls from the sky and lands on the top of the tower, and those who approach it will be granted one wish... ...The residents of the moon decided to host a tournament to decide who climbs to the top, many have tried and failed...",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3730600/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗通过召唤部队、建筑和法术进攻对方高塔，同时保护自己的塔不被先行摧毁。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Summon troops, buildings, and spells to destroy your opponent's towers before they destroy yours!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3730600/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "六十多张战斗卡牌配合会被动改造部队与高塔的遗物，形成持续变化的战术组合。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Over 60+ unique cards to use in battle Relics that provide passive effects that modify your troops and towers",
